[Intro]
bars: 2
grid: |: Gm . Bb . | Eb . D7 . :|

[Verse]
Take my heart,
It used to be so supple and sweet
Now it’s withered on the vine
There’s before
and then there’s after
you were mine

[Verse]
Take my faith,
So strong and full of fire
Now it’s bruised,
broken down and blind
There’s before
And then there’s after
You were mine
You were mine

[Chorus]
grid: |: D7 | % | % | D7 C Bb A | Gm . Bb . | Eb . D7 . | Gm | % :|
Sun comes up, sun goes down
World keeps rolling around and around
The hands on the clock Going tick tock tick tock
Ain’t the way I measure time
There’s just before
And then there’s after
You were mine
You were mine

[Solo]
